Test Files: 1 failed
Tests: 2 failed, 38 passed
failed assertions: immediate model fallback; no-fallback terminal recovery

$ pnpm test src/agents/embedded-agent-helpers/error-text.test.ts src/agents/embedded-agent-runner/run/assistant-failure.test.ts src/agents/embedded-agent-runner/run/failover-policy.test.ts src/agents/embedded-agent-runner/run/terminal-resolution.rejected-tool-call.test.ts --maxWorkers=1
passed: 3 Vitest shards, 98 tests
