Requires a llama-server build with --hf-repo support; the first run downloads the 633 MB Q8_0 model from Hugging Face. Save both files at the repository root. Provide sibling checkouts ../base-198996 at e4f55593741ed56f9bac9196847bb079f25c8d75 and ../base-stable-198996 at 847611dcaa3bf0e2783335f961dd1fd0580e4d9f, with dependencies installed. Set a shared MEMORY_PROOF_HF_HOME under your home directory, then run pnpm exec tsx proof-controller.mts for the pinned validation-base comparison and run it again with MEMORY_PROOF_BASE_REPO=../base-stable-198996 and MEMORY_PROOF_EXPECT_BASE_SHA=847611dcaa3bf0e2783335f961dd1fd0580e4d9f for the v6 migration check. Each run uses a fresh temporary state and workspace.

